  "document": "Castore e Polluce\nCastore e Polluce (\"Castor and Pollux\") is an \"opera seria\" by Francesco Bianchi. The libretto was one translated by Carlo Innocenzo Frugoni, from Pierre-Joseph-Justin Bernard's French text for Rameau's \"Castor et Pollux\"."
